<title>UK: Next says 24-week sales up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Next says 24-week sales up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British clothes retailer Next Plc said on Monday combined sales for Next Retail and Next Directory rose by 16 percent in the 24 weeks to January 11, 1997 from the year earlier period.</p>
<p>Next said British sales at Next Directory were up 26 percent while British and Eire sales at Next Retail were up 14 percent on selling space which was five percent higher.</p>
<p>Next said it would release preliminary results for the year to January 1997 on March 26.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
